pi/attested.py`` and\\n``api/feedback.py`` use: a bad category/kind must come back as a 400\\nnaming the problem, not FastAPI's generic 422, so validation happens in\\n:func:`cuore.live.owner_events.add` and its ``ValueError`` (turned into a\\n``BadRequest`` by the bridge) becomes the 400 here.\"\r\n}","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"0a3554cb-7402-4f01-936b-60a2b6ec827d","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/c/Users/User/mcp-servers","root":null,"branch":null,"default_branch":null,"status":null,"visibility":null,"error":"pending"},"live_cwd":"/c/Users/User/mcp-servers","platform":"windows"}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"e9bc7107-bba4-432c-84d9-8b0d34d2e82f","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"C:\\Users\\User\\mcp-servers","sessionId":"7cb02eb5-e299-4baf-b34b-9eb82aebbf17","version":"2.1.282","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"binary-splashing-comet"}
